title: 'sc-consensus-babe: skip epoch pruning when finalized header has no BABE pre-digest'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    `prune_finalized` assumed every finalized header carries a BABE pre-digest and panicked otherwise.
    That breaks constructing `BabeBlockImport` when finalized blocks were authored by another engine
    (e.g. during an Aura→BABE migration).

    Pruning is now skipped when the pre-digest is missing.
crates:
- name: sc-consensus-babe
  bump: patch
